/Title (Traditional metallic shielding reflects electromagnetic waves, which can create secondary interference. In contrast, N-graphene hybrid coatings are designed to absorb and dissipate electromagnetic energy as heat, reducing reflected radiation and improving electromagnetic compatibility. The system can be applied to flexible, rigid substrates with different geometries using conventional brushing techniques.)
